 Harry is loud.\n\nFrom point 10, loud, furry things are black. Harry is loud and furry, so Harry is black.\n\nSo, summarizing Harry\'s attributes: furry, hot, old, mean, loud, black.\n\nNow, the question is about Harry being square. Looking through all the given information, I do see several statements that mention the shape of some individuals. All the attributes mentioned are about being mean, loud, black, old, furry, hot, etc., and some of these do relate to shape or squareness.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, there\'s data that tells us whether Harry is square or not.</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']]
