d to the bear\'s temperature in many rules except point 17, which only affects the cat if the bear is warm, which it is.\n\nSo, the bear is cold, but the cat\'s temperature is still known.</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']] 19%|#9        | 116/600 [03:41<03:22,  2.39it/s]
